// Off-white page background on the front page, the colour the Do Your Own Research
// archive already sits on (pages/dyor-archive.styl). Direction of travel for the site:
// white boxed sections read as boxes against it, and it gives a boxed product block the
// option of a white box rather than a brand colour. Under evaluation on the Cortado
// revisions; front-page section joins (#613) assume it but do not set it.
//
// --page-background is for components that fade into the page (the products bar's edge
// gradients); they fall back to white-soft where it is unset.
body.home
  --page-background: var(--color-gray-base)
  background-color: var(--page-background)
